# Uniwind + RNR

Use `className` + `cn()` from `@/lib/cn`. Locked tokens: `bg` `#FFFFFF`, `surface` `#FFFFFF`, `ink` / `ink-soft` / `muted`, `line`, `primary` `#3452D9`, `primary-soft` `#E8EDFB`, `bubble-in` light `#FFFFFF` / dark `#2A2E3B`, `success`, `danger`, `amber`.

New `--color-*` tokens go in `@theme` (utility) **and** both `@variant light` and `@variant dark` with the same variable name. Uniwind only diffs `@variant` blocks — missing one side crashes Metro. Do not use arbitrary hex (`bg-[#…]`) for palette colors.

Light chrome only this phase. `Uniwind.setTheme('light')` + `userInterfaceStyle: "light"`. React Navigation `headerStyle` / `tabBarStyle` use hex from `@/lib/tokens`. Everything else is Uniwind. Lucide `color` props may use `colors.*` (icons have no `className`).

Do not invent a palette. Forbidden looks: nsave maroon, Messenger dark chrome, red outgoing bubbles. Incoming bubble = white + `border-line` on light / gray on dark (`bg-bubble-in`); outgoing = `primary`. RN `fontWeight` does not switch Manrope faces — `font-medium` / `font-semibold` / `font-bold` / `font-extrabold` map to `Manrope-Medium` / `Manrope-SemiBold` / `Manrope-Bold` / `Manrope-ExtraBold` in `global.css`. Prefer `Text` role variants from `components/ui/text.tsx`.

Forbidden: NativeWind, `cssInterop`, `remapProps`, `nativewind/babel`, wrapping RN core views with `withUniwind`. `expo-image` is a later phase — use RN `Image` until then.

RNR copies: `components/ui/` only. App UI: `components/hub/`, `components/inbox/`, `components/chat/` — create the folder when the first real file lands.

```tsx
// BAD
import { cssInterop } from "nativewind";

// GOOD
<View className={cn("bg-bg", className)} />;
```
